                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"100ce74d-f1c8-4fa6-8d9f-8878e10327c3\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2\\sin 2x-\\cos x=\\sqrt{3}\\sin x\\iff \\sin 2x=\\sin x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos x\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\sin 2x=\\sin (x+\\frac{\\pi}{6})\\iff \\sin 2x-\\sin (x+\\frac{\\pi}{6})=0\\iff 2\\cos (\\frac{3x}{2}+\\frac{\\pi}{12})\\sin (\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{\\pi}{12})=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos (\\frac{3x}{2}+\\frac{\\pi}{12})=0\\\\\\sin (\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{\\pi}{12})=0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3x}{2}+\\frac{\\pi}{12}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\\\\\frac{x}{2}-\\frac{\\pi}{12}=\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{5\\pi}{18}+\\frac{2\\pi k}{3}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p></center><p>б)  Отберём корни при по­мо­щи три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дят  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{11\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{19\\pi}{18}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{31\\pi}{18}\"></span> . </p>",
